    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d324">

                <pb facs="0431" n="265" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg265"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 793.94/583</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Morris to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-02T12:00:00+09:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 2, 1917, 12 p.m</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Text stated to be that [of the?] proposed joint note, in reference to China, was
                    confidentially given two days ago<anchor n="64" xml:id="d324-f1"/> by the
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs to the other Ambassadors here to take note of and
                    to communicate to their Governments. I am informed that he stated that it would
                    be signed without doubt in a day or two.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morris</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d324-f1" n="64" xml:id="d324-f1-content">
                <p>November 1, 1917. <hi rendition="#italic">See</hi> Ambassador Morris’s despatch
                    No. 7, November 16, 1917, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>. <ref
                        target="#pg271">p. 271</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
